<title>UK: LIFFE cocoa ends off lows, coffee rebounds.</title>
<headline>LIFFE cocoa ends off lows, coffee rebounds.</headline>
<text>
<p>COCOA - Ends lower but off lows in light trade. July four stg down at 1,020 stg.</p>
<p>COFFEE - Nearby positions rebound after NY's July hits new contract highs. July $15 higher at $2,101</p>
<p>SUGAR - Mixed in slow trade. August unchanged at $320.70 at 1601 GMT</p>
</text>
